MASTER AESTHETIC & SYSTEM RULES FOR VAULT WORLDWIDE:
Full language: docs/LANGUAGE.md — portable BLACK LANTERN canon (tokens, vetoes, SPECK save format, take/leave). Obey that file.
Overnight agent brief: docs/OVERNIGHT_PROMPT.md.
Product truth: PRODUCT.md. Visual system after build: DESIGN.md.

This is a dark studio: four tools as a fixed layout, not a dashboard, not a canvas OS, not stacked billboards.
The Manager is a racked instrument: five inset wells, plaque labels, modest fasteners. Jobs nest in a card well. Pulled subtasks are satellites on a taut filament. No DateBlocks, no SaaS kanban chrome, no PM nest stems.

PALETTE: Ground charcoal · panel/card slate · inset wells · off-white type · muted secondary · live orange (select, filament, caret) · danger red (URGENT, strike, CLEAR).
Live orange is not harvest amber identity. Danger red is not IMP `#E10600`. Cobalt has left. Paper/INV invert is not the identity. Cream cassette is not the OS plate.

TYPE: Helvetica Neue / Helvetica / Arial only. Job titles uppercase. Nested rows sentence case. No Oswald as identity. No JetBrains. No Space Grotesk.

COMPOSITION (desktop studio, not a PWA, not mobile-first):
1. Dark field. Rack fixed on top (project dropdown + ADD, then five wells), directory fixed under it, scratch sidebar on the right (~320px). FIND is the one command field (top of the sidebar). Sections do not drag.
2. One work graph. Directory is the full unix catalogue. Manager shows jobs of one project plus loose satellites. Nested (non-loose) children live in the card well. Ghost `+` in PENDING creates a job.
3. Naked unix directory: stems `│ ├── └──`, orange name-block behind the live name. Trailing `_` adds a child. TAB indent/outdent. Space / shovel stages onto the manager. Stems never appear in the PM GUI.
4. Scratch blocks snap-reorder vertically. Ghost `_ LINK` / `_ PIC` / `_ FILE` stay inert. NOTE when a txt block is focused; else FIND. `CLEAR` is a typed command. No DOS `>` dock slab.
5. SPECK source is the save format (`speck-os-v1`). Statuses `pending|rnd|active|done|dusted|none`. `LOOSE` marks a pulled satellite. Physics A: card moves, nested follow, loose stay, filament stretches.

HARD VETO: DateBlocks cards, jagged day cards, SaaS kanban chrome (avatars, KPIs, progress bars, “+ New Deal”), JSON-as-database, second prompt, cobalt lash, dump-parser dock, salt organs as identity (CAL / SEAL / SKULL), organ PLACE-drag, grain/scan overlays, Oswald plaques, 3D knobs, VU meters as KPIs, brass patch-cables, PM nest stems.
Do not revive beige cassette as the OS identity, month-as-OS as home, paper/black IMP canvas, or a Tailwind binder dashboard.
